# ReportCard Studio — optional server-side entitlement
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set BOTH values to enforce the 7 free uses, subscriptions and admin access
# server-side using the Ishmaverse `entitlement` Edge Function. Leave them empty
# and the app falls back to its local (localStorage) entitlement store.
#
# Admin identities (by email or IP) are configured on the SERVER via the
# ADMIN_EMAILS / ADMIN_IPS secrets — never here, so they cannot be spoofed.
#
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project>.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon key>
#
# See supabase/functions/SETUP_step9_limits_and_emails.md for the full setup.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
